WEBVTT

00:08.170 --> 00:13.280
Please answer the request which I am going to ask you with either "Okay" or "Yes."

00:13.280 --> 00:14.530
Hey.

00:17.440 --> 00:19.430
You said with either "Okay" or "Yes,"

00:19.430 --> 00:23.710
You're saying that I have no right to choose?!

00:23.750 --> 00:25.460
Just like you said.

00:25.460 --> 00:26.660
Hiiragi-san.

00:41.080 --> 00:44.680
Anzelotte, you bastard!!

00:44.680 --> 00:46.610
I told you my attendance is already bad enough!

00:47.170 --> 00:50.240
Let me go to school already!!

00:52.420 --> 00:54.620
When the red moon rises up in the sky,

00:55.930 --> 01:00.910
The dark tribe, The Emulators, will come to invade the earth.

01:01.420 --> 01:06.380
They are not affected by the human knowledge of science.

01:06.920 --> 01:08.210
Gunner's Broom.

01:32.490 --> 01:34.410
You're late, Hiiragi Renji.

01:40.200 --> 01:41.910
That hurts.

01:41.910 --> 01:45.040
Damn it, everyone keeps getting in my way.

01:51.560 --> 01:55.270
I'll never forgive myself if I can't graduate.

01:56.420 --> 01:58.390
I'll kill all of you at once...

01:58.390 --> 01:59.930
and I'm going back to school!

02:02.060 --> 02:04.930
The only force that goes against the darkness,

02:04.930 --> 02:07.530
are the ones long forgotten by humans.

02:07.530 --> 02:10.020
The ones who utilize magic to fight.

02:13.080 --> 02:16.220
They are called the Magicians of the Night,

02:16.220 --> 02:17.950
the Night Wizard.

04:10.040 --> 04:16.930
May your new school life bring you a joyful day, every day.

04:17.330 --> 04:20.360
I will always be looking after you.

04:20.790 --> 04:26.250
I am looking forward to meeting you on your seventeenth birthday.

04:29.050 --> 04:30.560
It's time already?!

04:30.560 --> 04:32.030
I'm going to be late!

04:43.170 --> 04:45.410
I'm off then, Oji-sama.

05:11.270 --> 05:13.050
A transfer student?

05:13.050 --> 05:15.310
Is that the uniform from her previous school?

05:16.790 --> 05:18.540
My name is Shiho Elis.

05:18.540 --> 05:20.870
Nice to meet you all.

05:20.870 --> 05:25.030
Although the new school term is just around the corner,

05:25.030 --> 05:29.030
please treat her as your classmate and get along with her.

05:29.030 --> 05:30.720
Okay!

05:34.210 --> 05:35.780
Is that girl the transfer student?

05:35.780 --> 05:36.770
She's quite cute.

05:36.770 --> 05:37.920
What's going on? Are those clubs trying to recruit her?

05:37.920 --> 05:40.040
Please join our action figure club!

05:40.040 --> 05:43.100
But I don't know anything about action figures.

05:43.100 --> 05:45.540
Then join our Pro-Wrestling Research Club!

05:45.540 --> 05:47.030
We welcome girls as well!

05:48.030 --> 05:50.600
Join our Occult Club, we'll give you the strangest youth you can ever experience!

05:50.600 --> 05:52.620
Join our Anime Club!

05:52.620 --> 05:54.290
Are you interested in bird watching?

05:54.290 --> 05:56.380
Join our Always on a Diet Research Club!

05:57.540 --> 05:59.030
Please, let me through!

05:59.030 --> 06:01.110
Make way!

06:04.660 --> 06:06.590
Do you like the stars?

06:06.590 --> 06:07.630
Stars?

06:07.630 --> 06:08.550
Yes.

06:08.550 --> 06:10.870
I am interested in star divination...

06:12.380 --> 06:16.630
Right?! Girls just love the stars, right?! As I thought!

06:16.630 --> 06:19.130
It's decided, she's joining The Astronomy Club!

06:37.390 --> 06:40.210
You really saved me by joining the club.

06:40.210 --> 06:44.040
If it went on like this, we would be disbanded.

06:44.040 --> 06:46.560
Um, what's your name?

06:46.560 --> 06:47.990
It's Shiho Elis.

06:48.340 --> 06:49.240
Um...

06:49.240 --> 06:52.290
Ah, sorry, I haven't told you my name yet, right?

06:52.290 --> 06:55.030
I am Akabane Kureha, third year.

06:55.030 --> 06:56.270
Nice to meet you.

06:57.110 --> 06:59.460
Kureha-san, you're such an interesting person.

07:03.520 --> 07:07.530
Why are you dressed like a shrine maiden even though you're in The Astronomy Club?

07:07.530 --> 07:08.610
Oh, this?

07:08.610 --> 07:11.530
I live in a temple, that's why I am always wearing this.

07:12.990 --> 07:16.580
That reminds me, why aren't you wearing our school uniform?

07:16.580 --> 07:19.330
This is the school uniform from my previous school.

07:19.330 --> 07:23.080
My transfer was kind of sudden, so I had no time to change it.

07:23.080 --> 07:26.000
You're transferring here... because of your father's job transfer?

07:26.000 --> 07:29.760
No, I live alone.

07:29.760 --> 07:32.180
Huh? You transferred here alone?!

07:32.550 --> 07:35.640
That's not it, it's just that I don't have any family.

07:36.760 --> 07:40.350
But I don't feel lonely.

07:40.350 --> 07:45.110
I was helped by a certain person when I was in the orphanage.

07:45.110 --> 07:48.480
And I am currently being looked after by that person.

07:48.480 --> 07:50.030
Is that so?

07:56.280 --> 07:57.740
Here, I'll give you half of mine.

07:57.740 --> 07:59.750
It's melon bread from the purchasing department in the school.

07:59.750 --> 08:03.250
It is famous for being the most delicious bread here in Akihabara.

08:04.250 --> 08:05.460
Thank you very much.

08:22.980 --> 08:25.020
At last, I'm here!

08:25.020 --> 08:29.230
I'm going to attend even if it's only the evening class!

08:34.990 --> 08:37.320
Hiiragi-san, here's your next mission.

08:37.320 --> 08:38.280
WHAT?!!

08:38.280 --> 08:42.830
Please answer the request which I am going to ask you with either "Okay" or "Yes."

08:41.500 --> 08:44.420
Wait a sec, my credit hour, my graduation!!

08:44.420 --> 08:47.380
Did you say something, Hiiragi-san?

08:50.460 --> 08:54.470
I beg you!! Please let me go to school!!

08:56.760 --> 08:57.930
What's wrong?

08:57.930 --> 09:01.100
Ah, I thought I heard Hiiragi's voice just now.

09:01.390 --> 09:02.560
Hiiragi?

09:02.560 --> 09:04.560
He's my childhood friend.

09:04.560 --> 09:08.110
He's supposed to graduate this year but he has problems coming to school.

09:08.110 --> 09:10.860
Is his body weak, or something?

09:10.860 --> 09:13.490
No, he's healthier than most humans.

09:13.490 --> 09:15.610
Is he playing truant or something?

09:15.610 --> 09:17.990
No, he's just unable to come.

09:17.990 --> 09:20.120
Such an unfortunate guy.

09:20.120 --> 09:21.950
He even dropped a grade once.

09:21.950 --> 09:24.620
He... dropped a grade?

09:24.620 --> 09:26.500
Did he have to repeat?

09:26.500 --> 09:28.790
It's not like that.

09:28.790 --> 09:30.500
It's a complicated matter.

09:30.500 --> 09:34.130
He's problematic even to a childhood friend like me.

09:36.680 --> 09:39.810
I'd like to meet this childhood friend of yours.

09:39.810 --> 09:44.640
In that case, I'll tie a rope around his neck and drag him to school tomorrow.

09:44.640 --> 09:47.650
He's also a member of The Astronomy Club.

09:52.070 --> 09:53.570
I'm hungry.

10:00.740 --> 10:03.290
Finally, I can have my lunch.

10:06.920 --> 10:09.290
At least let me eat my lunch in peace!

10:23.470 --> 10:27.650
This is the first time I've seen a shrine on a school rooftop.

10:27.650 --> 10:31.440
That's because Kimei Academy is a Shinto school.

10:31.440 --> 10:35.990
I've even heard that all the branch schools all over the country must have the same festival.

10:42.990 --> 10:44.790
Elis-chan, that's...?

10:44.790 --> 10:45.500
Yes?

10:45.500 --> 10:47.250
That's a weird bracelet you have there.

10:47.250 --> 10:48.870
Where did you buy that?

10:48.870 --> 10:51.130
It's not something I bought.

10:51.460 --> 10:56.590
It's just that... I've worn this ever since I could remember.

10:58.380 --> 11:02.090
Now then, is there any other place you want to go and see?

11:02.090 --> 11:03.050
Um...

11:03.050 --> 11:07.810
That swimming pool you see over there may look like one, but it is actually a gym.

11:08.230 --> 11:10.400
That's the mysterious radio tower.

11:10.400 --> 11:12.980
And that over there is the school's hostel.

11:12.980 --> 11:15.570
Students who come from rural areas live there.

11:21.530 --> 11:22.990
That tree...?

11:23.490 --> 11:27.450
Oh that? That tree is known as the Legendary tree.

11:27.450 --> 11:31.460
It's an old sakura tree and has been there before the school was built.

11:32.000 --> 11:36.460
They say that if you confess your love under that tree, it will bloom.

11:36.460 --> 11:38.720
That is why they called it The Legendary Tree.

11:39.470 --> 11:41.220
Are you interested in it?

11:41.220 --> 11:44.430
Elis-chan, don't tell me you have someone you like.

11:44.430 --> 11:46.970
No, I don't have anyone.

11:53.110 --> 11:53.940
Elis-chan?!

12:03.570 --> 12:05.620
What's wrong? Are you all right?

12:05.620 --> 12:08.240
I had a sudden headache.

12:08.750 --> 12:10.750
But I'm all right.

12:17.380 --> 12:18.960
I've found her.

12:19.510 --> 12:21.760
Is it that school as expected?

12:21.760 --> 12:22.970
Bell Zephyr.

12:23.470 --> 12:27.010
That's right, it's the transfer student from Kimei Academy.

12:27.010 --> 12:32.730
Shall we have some fun before Anzelotte gets in our way?

12:33.480 --> 12:35.310
It looks like things are going to become interesting.

12:48.490 --> 12:54.040
Oji-sama, I've joined up with Kimei Academy's Astronomy Club.

12:55.920 --> 13:00.460
My senior, Akabane Kureha, is a very cheerful and energetic student.

13:00.460 --> 13:03.550
She is a very fun person to be with.

13:04.340 --> 13:09.640
We're approaching my seventeenth birthday; our promised day, right?

13:10.100 --> 13:13.890
I am looking forward to meeting you, Oji-sama.

13:21.360 --> 13:23.740
I can finally go to school.

13:23.740 --> 13:27.280
Today was much harder than usual.

13:27.280 --> 13:28.910
Hiiragi-san!!

13:31.580 --> 13:36.960
Please answer the request which I am going to ask you with either "Okay" or "Yes."

13:37.540 --> 13:40.500
You're listening, right, Hiiragi-san?

13:43.590 --> 13:46.010
Please let me have a normal school life just like everyone else!

13:46.010 --> 13:48.800
Let me go to school!!

13:50.600 --> 13:51.810
Hiiragi?!

13:53.060 --> 13:54.890
Must be my imagination.

14:22.840 --> 14:25.380
Good night, Oji-sama.

14:43.360 --> 14:44.530
The moon...!!

15:09.840 --> 15:11.840
My light...

15:16.270 --> 15:17.980
is calling me...

15:25.940 --> 15:27.820
A red moon?!

15:38.450 --> 15:39.660
Elis-chan!

15:47.380 --> 15:50.300
They moved... just as I thought.

15:50.300 --> 15:53.300
This looks like fun, Greater Devil Bell.

15:53.300 --> 15:56.100
Leon, if we don't have fun now, it'd be too late.

15:56.640 --> 15:59.060
Because this is all a game.

16:09.280 --> 16:10.860
Elis-chan!

16:59.080 --> 17:00.830
My light...

17:01.410 --> 17:02.710
Come back...

17:02.710 --> 17:04.080
Come back to me.

17:22.470 --> 17:23.560
Elis-chan...

17:27.810 --> 17:29.230
Kureha-san?

17:29.230 --> 17:30.570
Are you all right?

17:30.570 --> 17:32.690
And what is that ball?

17:36.070 --> 17:38.620
When did I...?

17:39.120 --> 17:40.370
Where is this place?

17:50.380 --> 17:52.250
S-Sakuras are...!!

17:52.250 --> 17:54.130
This is... The Lunar Casket!?

17:52.250 --> 17:56.590
Note: The Lunar Casket is a separate field created by The Emulators that disables the world shield's effect.

17:54.590 --> 17:55.800
Moonlight?

18:12.070 --> 18:13.320
A Chimera?!

18:18.570 --> 18:21.910
Now then, I wonder how Anzelotte will react to this.

18:23.370 --> 18:25.290
Elis-chan, get back.

18:27.830 --> 18:29.250
BOWTEX!

18:38.550 --> 18:40.090
K-Kureha-san...?

18:40.090 --> 18:41.100
It's not affecting it.

18:41.550 --> 18:42.720
Elis-chan, run!

18:59.860 --> 19:01.200
Elis-chan!

19:11.630 --> 19:12.960
Hiiragi!

19:12.960 --> 19:18.470
Damn it, I thought I would finally be able to get back to school, and suddenly I'm here battling!!

19:22.550 --> 19:23.600
Hiiragi!

19:23.600 --> 19:25.810
This is the third time today.

19:26.310 --> 19:28.810
Let me tell you first, I am really pissed off right now.

19:29.100 --> 19:31.600
Don't think I'll let you get away even if you beg for it!

19:31.600 --> 19:32.810
Prepare yourself!

19:34.110 --> 19:38.490
This guy is Kureha-san's childhood friend, Hiiragi-san?!

19:43.950 --> 19:44.830
You!!

19:45.450 --> 19:47.040
TUMBLING DOWN!

19:57.210 --> 19:58.300
Shit!

19:58.300 --> 20:00.010
Its target is...

20:00.340 --> 20:01.680
It's coming.

20:02.630 --> 20:05.140
Save me, Oji-sama!

20:08.020 --> 20:09.180
The ball!

20:44.760 --> 20:45.800
That's...

20:45.800 --> 20:46.800
a Broom?!

20:46.800 --> 20:48.890
Don't tell me Elis-chan...

20:48.890 --> 20:49.770
You're...

20:54.100 --> 20:55.560
Unlock Magical Aura!

21:36.810 --> 21:38.940
That bracelet...

21:38.940 --> 21:41.690
I didn't know that you're a wizard.

21:41.690 --> 21:43.070
Wizard?

21:43.070 --> 21:45.450
So you are Shiho Elis?

21:46.070 --> 21:48.320
I am Hiiragi Renji.

21:48.320 --> 21:50.530
I have come here to protect you.

22:00.170 --> 22:02.590
One of those jewels we saw.

22:03.090 --> 22:05.050
That must be the "Jewel of Kindness", huh.

22:05.510 --> 22:09.050
The wizards are finally starting to take action.

22:09.050 --> 22:14.060
Hiiragi Renji's appearance matches what was written in this book.

22:14.850 --> 22:16.810
Hiiragi Renji.

22:16.810 --> 22:20.060
Looks like he'll make our next game more enjoyable.

22:35.370 --> 22:39.290
Looks like you completed your last mission for the day safely, right?

22:39.290 --> 22:41.210
Thank you for your hard work, Hiiragi-san.

22:42.840 --> 22:44.880
Shiho Elis-san.

22:45.260 --> 22:47.380
Welcome to my palace.

22:47.380 --> 22:49.220
I am Anzelotte.

22:49.220 --> 22:51.300
The one protecting the Earth.

22:51.300 --> 22:53.060
The one... protecting the Earth?

22:53.810 --> 22:55.850
Now then, Elis-san.

22:55.850 --> 22:57.060
Y-Yes?

22:57.520 --> 23:02.270
Please answer the request which I am going to ask you with either "Okay" or "Yes."

24:51.260 --> 24:52.680
Oji-sama, this is trouble.

24:52.680 --> 24:55.720
I have become a savior of the world.

24:55.720 --> 25:00.560
And due to Anzelotte-san's request, I've ended up living with Hiiragi-senpai.

25:00.560 --> 25:04.690
Hiiragi-senpai, though it's going to be short, please take good care of me.

25:05.190 --> 25:10.110
Next episode in Night Wizard THE ANIMATION, Fallen Man, the World is the target.

25:10.610 --> 25:13.030
You think I'm going to sink any lower than this?!

25:13.030 --> 25:14.910
I'm going to school!!
